messages[14]{user,text}:
  user_1,Hello? ... uh hi Ravi this is Sai. I just got a notification that my home policy... [00:05] ... says it's expired as of yesterday.
  user_2,Hey Sai yeah I see that... let me pull up your file. One sec... [typing]
  user_1,Sure take your time. I was wondering... um... what are my options now?
  user_2,Okay so the policy #HC-2026-7854 actually expired on 15 Aug 2027. Since you're past the grace period we can either renew it for another year or you could switch to a new plan.
  user_1,Oh okay I guess I'd like to renew same coverage plus the garage addition we did earlier.
  user_2,Got it. That would be the same $1,250 base plus the $150 garage endorsement total $1,400 for the next year. Does that work?
  user_1,Umm yeah that sounds fine. Can we process that now over the phone?
  user_2,Sure thing. I'll just need to confirm your address... is it still 45 Oak Street Apt 3B?
  user_1,Yes that's correct [sighs] Actually I moved last month to 78 Pine Lane Unit 5. Sorry I forgot to update.
  user_2,No worries let me update that. One moment... Okay address updated. I'm going to charge the $1,400 now. You'll receive a confirmation email shortly.
  user_1,Thanks Ravi I appreciate it. And uh when will the next reminder be sent?
  user_2,We'll send a renewal reminder 30 days before the new expiry on 15 Aug 2028. Anything else I can help with?
  user_1,No that's all. Thanks again.
  user_2,You're welcome! Have a great day.